  "body": "### What is the issue with the Web IDL Standard?\n\nhttps://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#js-dictionary, step 4.1.3 has a `?` which links to https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-returnifabrupt-shorthands, but the fragment link seems to be broken.\n\nI think this is the new URL?\nhttps://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-shorthands-for-unwrapping-completion-records",
